Prerequisite: register and log in as grader_review_user, storing the session cookie in $env:TEMP\grader-review.cookies.

Command (PowerShell, add or modify the review):
curl.exe -i -X PUT "http://localhost:5000/customer/auth/review/1?review=First%20review" -b "$env:TEMP\grader-review.cookies" -c "$env:TEMP\grader-review.cookies"

Output (HTTP 200):
{"message":"Review added or updated successfully."}

Command (retrieve the reviews after adding):
curl.exe -i http://localhost:5000/review/1

Output (HTTP 200):
{"grader_review_user":"First review"}
